[ar:Bryant Barnes]
[ti:I'd Rather Pretend]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : Andrew Luce/Bryant Barnes/Calle Lehmann/Kristoffer Eriksson
[00:00.26]作曲 : Andrew Luce/Bryant Barnes/Calle Lehmann/Kristoffer Eriksson
[00:00.52](Verse 1:)
[00:03.38]Love
[00:03.38]亲爱的
[00:04.64]Guess you found a way to get through
[00:04.64]你似乎释怀了过去
[00:06.63]Got so used to feeling nothing at all
[00:06.63]裹在情感空洞的惯性
[00:13.73]For so long (long)
[00:13.73]漫长岁月里 (岁月里)
[00:16.68]Now all I want to do is love you
[00:16.68]如今我只愿爱你
[00:22.44]But my head is holding up my heart, my heart
[00:22.44]可理智束缚着我的心 我的心
[00:29.70](Pre-chorus:)
[00:31.61]And I've seen all the signs
[00:31.61]我眼中所见迹象
[00:36.72]What if they're all lies?
[00:36.72]倘若都是谎
[00:39.18]Will it even matter what you say?
[00:39.18]你的言语是否仍有分量
[00:44.44]Can you make these feelings go away?
[00:44.44]你能不能让情愫都随风飘扬
[00:45.87](Chorus:)
[00:47.17]Tell me is this real to you?
[00:47.17]告诉我 对你来说有几分真心？
[00:51.15]Cause I can feel my heart again
[00:51.15]因为我依然会心头鹿撞
[00:55.17]You're so tempting but I'm scared so I'd rather pretend
[00:55.17]秀色可餐的你 可我却心生恐惧 所以我宁愿假装
[01:02.89]That I don't love you like I do
[01:02.89]假装我不爱你 一如我表现的那样
[01:05.89]Cause I don't wanna hurt again
[01:05.89]因为我不想又一次受伤
[01:09.57]I wanna love you but I'm scared so I'd rather pretend
[01:09.57]我想爱你 但我心生恐惧 所以我宁愿假装
[01:18.41]I'd rather pretend
[01:18.41]我宁愿假装
[01:22.07]I'd rather pretend, oh oh oh
[01:22.07]我宁愿选择假装 oh oh oh
[01:25.89](Verse 2:)
[01:30.95]But if I'm out of lies
[01:30.95]可如若我百口莫辩 用尽谎言
[01:33.04]Hoping you'll come back to me when you're gone
[01:33.04]但愿你走后 还会回到我身边
[01:36.64]There's so many ways I've seen this going wrong
[01:36.64]我曾目睹太多这样的关系走向歧途
[01:40.22]So many ways I've seen this fall apart
[01:40.22]我曾目睹太多这样的关系分崩离析
[01:42.52](Pre-chorus:)
[01:44.56]Cause I've seen all the signs
[01:44.56]因为我眼中所见迹象
[01:48.36]What if they're all lies?
[01:48.36]倘若都是谎
[01:52.60]Will it even matter what you say?
[01:52.60]你的言语是否仍有分量
[01:56.31]Can you make these feelings go away?
[01:56.31]你能不能让情愫都随风飘扬
[01:59.30](Chorus:)
[01:59.98]Tell me is this real to you?
[01:59.98]告诉我 对你来说有几分真心？
[02:05.84]Cause I can feel my heart again
[02:05.84]因为我依然会心头鹿撞
[02:08.64]You're so tempting, but I'm scared so I'd rather pretend
[02:08.64]秀色可餐的你 可我却心生恐惧 所以我宁愿假装
[02:16.73]That I don't love you like I do
[02:16.73]假装我不爱你 一如我表现的那样
[02:20.62]Cause I don't wanna hurt again
[02:20.62]因为我不想又一次受伤
[02:23.26]I wanna love you but I'm scared so I'd rather pretend
[02:23.26]我想爱你 但我心生恐惧 所以我宁愿假装
[02:31.50](Pretend, pretend)
[02:31.50](假装 选择假装)
